def distribute_multibox_and : 𝓢 ⊢ □^[n](φ ⋏ ψ) ➝ □^[n]φ ⋏ □^[n]ψ := implyRightAnd (implyMultiboxDistribute' and₁) (implyMultiboxDistribute' and₂)
@[simp] lemma distribute_multibox_and! : 𝓢 ⊢! □^[n](φ ⋏ ψ) ➝ □^[n]φ ⋏ □^[n]ψ := ⟨distribute_multibox_and⟩

