def multibox_axiomK' (h : 𝓢 ⊢ □^[n](φ ➝ ψ)) : 𝓢 ⊢ □^[n]φ ➝ □^[n]ψ := multibox_axiomK ⨀ h
omit [DecidableEq F] in @[simp] lemma multibox_axiomK'! (h : 𝓢 ⊢! □^[n](φ ➝ ψ)) : 𝓢 ⊢! □^[n]φ ➝ □^[n]ψ := ⟨multibox_axiomK' h.some⟩

